 to the truth - what guilt led the hero to the brink of doom. Follow the clues; they may be encrypted or hidden, do not miss them, for they are valuable knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass tests and puzzles. You will face not only routine tasks at the mill, like grinding flour and baking bread; at night you may meet those who will cause trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not listen to the words of evil spirits. Mara at all times poured nightmares on people and replaced reality; do not give in to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596680/extras/1f217e5b981710e3ae9360883ae94523.poster.avif?t=1772001699\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596680/extras/1f217e5b981710e3ae9360883ae94523.webm?t=1772001699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596680/extras/1f217e5b981710e3ae9360883ae94523.mp4?t=1772001699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the only advice: in no case let the evil spirits take power over you, do not let nightmares into your mind, then a bright outcome awaits you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear gameplay and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle with a curse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements of Slavic culture</p></li></ul>","developers":["Spear and Veil"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596680/2612da680e1688bf30f41ab57fd54b73